Complete local Java example; the app itself does not execute it:
```java
import java.util.function.ToIntFunction;
public class Main {
  static int length(String text) { return text.length(); }
  public static void main(String[] args) {
    ToIntFunction<String> measure = Main::length;
    System.out.println(measure.applyAsInt("map"));
  }
}
```

